674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RiPV8TJF0Q0Q7kNvwGpqFDA&_nc_oc=AdqeRxHMPN-ElvOU6FLBaKacw5Qf8dsphC4eRop5M5lJ6I214xm9qZ2yml82wNu4Pnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZpPZKbj54sGXTMBXZJU-RK66invbcz2nnfjCsFNV4Fg&oe=6ABA7A59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SpBSEtA-SMEQ7kNvwEn4S_3&_nc_oc=AdoeXEHylfHvwhY5tHanumxKvqTqsGFQ4axqT9jSOlYMrQ04uehtqKjDuiQPlexyPKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLlfHhgfIiH3eelaC5Hx_Eh5mdLH0pyzIL1aH7o02tBSg&oe=6ABA8316"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bs7M1WNmiCkQ7kNvwFtQ6xq&_nc_oc=AdosUvBh7q8A3fcdLjDh_njvjbf5nUAFkso0KJRD_ffrqTRQ9juU7eiQxazgBvmgkrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtWwS-Msu3TSEDWyVY81WstWD0sI99mTMV5bqh34uRvQ&oe=6ABA7F31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip